This repository ("BigDataDesk") bundles personal scripts, configuration templates,
and installation tooling released under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
for compatibility with KDE Plasma, Darkly, KWin Effects Better Blur DX, and
Smart Video Wallpaper Reborn.

Full license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

